    "question": {
      ":question/id": "edf077ea-7e87-5479-94ce-ec06feecfc35",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Express $\\cos(x-150^\\circ)$ in terms of $\\sin x$ and $\\cos x$.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use $\\cos(u-v)=\\cos u\\cos v+\\sin u\\sin v$ with $u=x$ and $v=150^\\circ$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\cos(x-150^\\circ)&=\\cos x\\cos 150^\\circ+\\sin x\\sin 150^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\cos x\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)+\\sin x\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\\\\n&=\\frac{1}{2}\\sin x-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
